{
  "_readme": [
    "Every number Baraza displays anywhere — README, architecture diagram, video",
    "overlay, console output — traces to an entry in this file, to a live query, or",
    "to a script a judge can run. Nothing is typed into a document by hand.",
    "",
    "An entry is either the literal string \"not yet measured\" or an object carrying",
    "value, provenance, run_id and date. There is no third form, and no placeholder",
    "estimate: a plausible number where a measured one belongs is the defect this",
    "file exists to prevent.",
    "",
    "provenance is one of:",
    "  \"measured in-process\"  — timed inside a local process; NOT a deployed number",
    "  \"measured deployed\"    — timed against the deployed Cloud Run surface",
    "  \"not yet measured\"     — no run has produced this yet",
    "",
    "scripts/compliance.py fails the build on any entry that breaks this shape."
  ],

